# benches/

This directory contains Criterion benchmarks for the Entry gRPC service and related functionality. Benchmarks measure the full gRPC stack including authentication, routing, and database operations against a live PostgreSQL instance.

## Dirs
- `common/` -- shared benchmark fixture setup and harness utilities

## Files
- `entry_service.rs` -- Criterion benchmarks for Entry service operations (create, lookup by key, lookup by context)
